            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are water-resistant and/or photoprotective compositions including: (a) an aqueous phase including from 0% to 99.9% by weight of the composition, based on the total weight of the composition; (b) an oil phase including from 0% to 99.9% by weight of the composition, based on the total weight of the composition; (c) an active sun block agent; and (d) a micronized, non-solubilized wax including 0.1% to 10% by weight of the composition, based on the total weight of the composition; wherein the wax has a D50 particle size of 1 to 100 µm, and a melting point of at least 70 °C; and wherein the composition includes at least 50% by weight of at least one of the aqueous phase or the oil phase. Uses of the compositions, and methods utilizing the compositions, are also provided.</p>
            </abstract>
